### Erabiltzaileak eskuratu (GET)
GET http://localhost:8000/erabiltzaileak

###

### Erabiltzaile bat sortu (POST)
POST http://localhost:8000/erabiltzaileak
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Proba",
    "abizena": "Abizena",
    "email": "proba@example.com",
    "telefonoa": "666666666",
    "password": "password",
    "password_confirmation": "password"
}

###

### Erabiltzaile bat eskuratu (GET)
GET http://localhost:8000/erabiltzaileak/3

###

### Erabiltzaile bat editatu (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8000/erabiltzaileak/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Proba editatu",
    "abizena": "Abizena editatu",
    "email": "proba@example.com",
    "telefonoa": "666666666"
}

###

### Erabiltzaile bat ezabatu (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/erabiltzaileak/3
Accept: application/json